  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      417.43,
      286.67,
      487.76
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land acquisition (amended) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intend to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599039554595947,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      491.59,
      286.65,
      535.04
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land or servitude to be acquired: Acquire the land for the Karagasthalawa Primary School.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      536.48,
      286.69,
      592.64
    ],
    "text": "Allotments of land: Lot No. 276 in Extent about 1.2140 Hectares depicted in supplementary No. 13 in F.V.P. 591 situated at Karagasthalawa village Karagasthalawa G.S. Division Kadawatha Korale",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      331.28,
      539.6,
      352.88
    ],
    "text": "Imbulpe Divisional Secretariat, Rathnapura District and Sabaragamuwa Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      353.81,
      539.63,
      531.64
    ],
    "text": "All Person interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to be acquire are here by required appear personally, or by agent duly authorized in writing, before me at Imbulpe Divisional Secretariat on the 30th day of January, 2015 at 9.30 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 16th day of January, 2015 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for the compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude the amount of compensation of such amount. J. L. C. K. JAYASINGHA, Divisional Secretary, Imbulpe.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
